        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "ce4dd5a8-9961-53e8-b54f-2fe756e63ff5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Original Soundtrack, I’m Not in Love, Relayted, Affiliyated\n- People: Eric Stewart, Graham Gouldman\n- Organizations: 10cc, Gayngs, Doomtree\n- Concepts: singles, remix EPs, tempo\n\nFacts:\n- The Original Soundtrack includes the singles \"Life Is a Minestrone\" and \"I'm Not in Love.\"\n- \"I'm Not in Love\" was the most popular song by 10cc.\n- \"I'm Not in Love\" is a song by the English group 10cc.\n- Eric Stewart and Graham Gouldman, both band members of 10cc, wrote \"I'm Not in Love.\"\n- Relayted was inspired by 10cc's \"I'm Not in Love.\"\n- Every song on Relayted was recorded at 69 BPM.\n- Relayted was Gayngs' 2010 debut album.\n- Affiliyated is a remix EP of Gayngs' 2010 debut album Relayted.\n- Doomtree created the remix EP Affiliyated.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
